# The lockfile IS committed, deliberately. It used to be ignored, which was fine
# while the suites only ever ran on somebody's laptop — and invisible until CI
# tried to check out a file that had never been in the repository.
#
# It earns its place beyond that: these suites exist to catch regressions in the
# game, so a Playwright that silently moves a minor version and changes
# behaviour makes them fail for reasons that are not the code's. That is the
# same rule the fake tile server exists to honour.
